WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:04.400
Miss Chen, I have no reason to withhold the truth from you.

00:04.600 --> 00:09.200
I came today precisely to persuade Imperial Father to lift Eldest Brother's confinement.

00:09.520 --> 00:15.200
There was no need for you to stage this elaborate scapegoat spectacle. He is a human being with parents—grant him a way out alive.

00:21.640 --> 00:27.200
If that is the case... it shall be as the Prince of Jin wishes.

00:29.320 --> 00:30.500
Move out!
